{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_015_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_015_title", "source_sha256": "130be83b290b32a0e983f9207909b0132dae5656e5e0b6512a4bf90349841a57", "ja": "飾らない言葉　飾れない心", "zh": "毫不掩饰的话，毫不掩饰的心", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_015_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_015_synopsis", "source_sha256": "42101374832a33ef76b772855834af508ec3930271ba7bf0d2caee050591bc55", "ja": "次回公演のセンターに選ばれ、一人でレッス\nンに励む志保。プロデューサーはそんな志保\nに、伊織とやよいの練習を見学しないかと提\n案する。仲間の大切さを学んだ志保は、可奈\nや茜とレッスンを再開、公演を成功に導く。", "zh": "志保被选为下次公演的Center后，\n便独自一人专心在训练课程上。制作人见状，\n便建议她去观摩伊织和弥生的练习。\n志保体会到伙伴的重要性之后，\n与可奈和茜重启训练课程，为公演带来成功。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_015_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_015_1000_p", "source_sha256": "12c7877b5768834246da779894e30496a4bcd884a080a88d0fed3c7a0b4160b5", "ja": "（志保が初めてセンターを務めた公演は、無事に幕を\nおろした……のだが、歓声がいまだに鳴り止まない！）", "zh": "（首次由志保担任Center的公演平安落幕了……\n然而，观众的欢呼声至今久久未停歇！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_015_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_015_1001_036kan", "source_sha256": "d6751824b5898702f9e89cf587c7a38ad77ba8663981cbfcd88f59be5a1b8ef1", "ja": "茜さん、志保ちゃん、お疲れさま！　お客さんも\nすっごく喜んでくれて、すっごーく楽しかったね～♪", "zh": "茜、志保，辛苦了！\n观众们也看得很开心，真是快乐的时光呢～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_015_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_015_1002_023aka", "source_sha256": "564119a85ecf88932e19486839d5d3920186188984814c7c40d2355b46ed5898", "ja": "にゃーはははははっ！\n茜ちゃんにかかれば、当然の結果なのだー！", "zh": "喵～哈哈哈哈哈！\n有小茜出马，这也是理所当然的──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_015_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_015_1003_023aka", "source_sha256": "8a5e22f7a3b1b06d4b4c70c8ef2af9181082b0741a0e3dbdf6a3e0f2275df1ac", "ja": "しほりん、可奈ちゃん！　最後までよく茜ちゃんに\nついてきたね！　あとでナデナデしてあげるよ～！", "zh": "志保保、小可奈！你们一直到最后都有跟上小茜！\n等会摸摸头奖励你们～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_015_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_015_1004_p", "source_sha256": "06e4da6b8ea115565d964ce94647a18ba1b0e4fe31b8336c997f0e05f154345a", "ja": "みんな、お疲れさま！　練習の成果がバッチリ出た、\nいい公演だったな。息もピッタリだったぞ！", "zh": "大家辛苦了！完美展现练习的成果，真是精采的公演。\n你们的默契也是绝佳喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_015_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_015_1005_033sih", "source_sha256": "13ffcfccd534845828c89ea8ff446aff8d40d508ff7fd065395eb5fccd7bcf37", "ja": "確かに上手くいきましたが、それは言いすぎです。", "zh": "表演确实是很顺利，但这么说可就过奖了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_015_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_015_1006_033sih", "source_sha256": "31708b27ab8d49016ea2a9e43eeefb6697946e491286c54b0ba5b13b173f51ed", "ja": "細かいズレがいくつもありましたし。\n小さなミスもたくさんありました。", "zh": "当中还是有些细微的地方乱掉。\n小失误也非常多。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_015_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_015_1007_p", "source_sha256": "a768f075a3bc496f27e5c5b7cc02d080bf18b9b8fdcd544d7bff6163b3f9179d", "ja": "なんだ、もう反省会か？\nもちろん、まだまだ課題はあると思うけど。", "zh": "怎么，已经在开检讨会了？\n不过确实是还有很多课题要努力没错。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_015_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_015_1008_023aka", "source_sha256": "1536caef52db59c439ef6bd9ab293d9b80922e622ba4501700f745e6bb0eaa1b", "ja": "そうだね～。しほりん、ターンの時、コケそうに\nなってたしね！　茜ちゃんの目はごまかせないのだ！", "zh": "对啊～志保保，你在转圈时，差点就要跌倒了！\n休想逃过小茜的法眼！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_015_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_015_1009_033sih", "source_sha256": "25291faadd7fbc9862820c7fa1675e738f2c4997e32ffd4f5f0f167ad9028d6b", "ja": "そういう茜さんこそ、高くジャンプしすぎて\nタイミングがズレてたじゃないですか。", "zh": "茜你才是，因为跳得太高，\n导致落地的时机跟大家不同步不是吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_015_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_015_1010_023aka", "source_sha256": "4700e8ac441500f414c0bcdd51fa0d35ca49882a2dd236e09ebba491d5b066b1", "ja": "なんとっ！？　まさか、気づかれていたとは……。\nしほりんの目も、ごまかせないのだ！", "zh": "什么！？竟然被发现了……\n看来志保保的法眼也不是盖的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_015_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_015_1011_033sih", "source_sha256": "89f49e288070c6db8714cd39a4dc2a1b1877b13620c39a4b23940547fd11509a", "ja": "あと、可奈もステージの前に出る時につまづいて、\n練習の時と同じミスしてたわ。", "zh": "还有，可奈走到舞台前的时候又绊到，\n犯了跟练习时一样的失误。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_015_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_015_1012_023aka", "source_sha256": "ab1c5386ad9cfbcf663bf76b72e9f99c6a35e37a765e7cc5eeaa6a997c756f2a", "ja": "にゃ？", "zh": "喵？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_015_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_015_1013_036kan", "source_sha256": "2779c82565746bb65d8119629003c87d1183a3249e387a971716a3345f3b1b02", "ja": "え？　……あ、ごめんね志保ちゃん。\n誰の話？", "zh": "咦？……啊，抱歉，志保。\n你在说谁？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_015_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_015_1014_033sih", "source_sha256": "8304c941359395922042d7f76ec82e7ddc1a3b1369c701f79b748863758ad3c8", "ja": "？　可奈の話に決まってるじゃない。", "zh": "嗯？当然是可奈啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_015_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_015_1015_036kan", "source_sha256": "83af90fcd0319161ab3bf9e93c1fad6c27961acaee42b09017786f381456edee", "ja": "私……そっか！\nえへへっ、ありがとう！", "zh": "我吗……这样啊！\n嘿嘿，谢谢你！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_015_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_015_1016_023aka", "source_sha256": "a4530fc5961697ab941f46eb055f57a05cdbb9e53cfbeaa6b8be8e197c5b8049", "ja": "あれ？　あれれれれ～？　しほりんって、\n可奈ちゃんのこと名前で呼んでたっけ？？", "zh": "咦？咦咦咦咦～？志保保，\n你之前是直接叫小可奈的名字吗？？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_015_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_015_1017_033sih", "source_sha256": "932199376a5aa67dcac62976f14ac632f139e6588da95fd05c42714be2acebb9", "ja": "え？　あ……！", "zh": "咦？啊……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_015_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_015_1018_036kan", "source_sha256": "8a9ea06682dd1f886eb821d0c13c4c46f5b768835ef3763c8584938d9fd090ed", "ja": "志保ちゃん……！", "zh": "志保……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_015_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_015_1019_033sih", "source_sha256": "9e16822162777256318e6d90903deb2d56935daa73afe05ba1cf5eae8dbc94ae", "ja": "ち、違います。今のは、その……。", "zh": "不、不是的。刚才那是，那个……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_015_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_015_1020_036kan", "source_sha256": "c9279888f9614a8c0f6f067dbd9867f173f19fd26af69589660e20ef86c8bb6c", "ja": "いいの志保ちゃん！　これからも可奈って呼んでね？\n私も志保ちゃんって呼ぶから！　もう呼んでるけど！", "zh": "没关系的，志保！你今后就叫我可奈吧，\n我也会叫你志保的！虽然已经这样叫了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_015_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_015_1021_033sih", "source_sha256": "c9afbbed9a9536d35f193abd29633fc990f717aa746ec7026424ecb19ed7528f", "ja": "そ……そう……。", "zh": "这……这样啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_015_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_015_1022_036kan", "source_sha256": "8e5f24bdba781d40c1b463dea7da5391f193f461a16eb59b1cc20f53b900dd68", "ja": "やった～！　えへへっ、うれちいな～♪\n今日から可奈は、可奈かな～♪", "zh": "太好了～！嘿嘿，好开薰喔～♪\n可奈从今天开始，就叫可奈～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_015_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_015_1024_023aka", "source_sha256": "972bc7a053b6ae55da32551106581c4bc0ba3dc4acfc8583e6e4e5224c6c14e7", "ja": "{$P$}ちゃん、聞いた聞いた？\n今しほりんがデレたよね？　デレりん現るの巻だよね？", "zh": "小{$P$}，你有听到吗？\n志保保刚才害羞了对吧？是「羞保保出现之卷」对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_015_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_015_1025_033sih", "source_sha256": "427bfe72610a33746c16594b2872ea4906498882f4863570837a5756fc2456eb", "ja": "聞こえてますよ。よくわかりませんけど……。\nたぶん、全然違いますからっ。", "zh": "我都听见了，虽然不是很懂你在说什么……\n但应该完全不是那个意思。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_015_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_015_1026_p", "source_sha256": "5a12253e346be03129ef5ada5699b5a35fe13864b75e1641f1018307e4afbf91", "ja": "あはは、わかったわかった。ほら、3人とも、\nそろそろ片付けが始まるから、控え室に戻るぞ。", "zh": "哈哈，知道了知道了。好了，你们三个，\n差不多要开始收拾了，回去准备室吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_015_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_015_1027_033sih", "source_sha256": "a0407bb97b22dd65341d1b5f2f3ac3e7066082a4415abbc308a06c4a76b100c4", "ja": "そ、そうですよね。わかりました。", "zh": "说、说得也是，我明白了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_015_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_015_1028_036kan", "source_sha256": "1bc6ad8d0d49aeadd5cf20e177eed4a4e4bcd431eebedbb85eb5196512e1f946", "ja": "え～。なんだか、今はもっと……\nいっぱい、おしゃべりしていたいな～。", "zh": "哎～总觉得现在……\n想要再多聊久一会呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_015_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_015_1029_023aka", "source_sha256": "4fc863b7de23f5638d361eb1af2f5aa1926633523ee2d5e3ddf3dbafd56eec5e", "ja": "そうだね可奈ちゃん！　茜ちゃんも超しゃべり足りない\nから、みんなでプリン食べに行こう！　レッツゴー！！", "zh": "就是说啊，小可奈！小茜也聊得超不满足，\n所以大家一起去吃布丁吧！Let's go！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_015_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_015_1030_033sih", "source_sha256": "44f5f3500617cae1ede6f535dc2fc4ef80161c0739a0fcf223040eebd4f89a9f", "ja": "私は遠慮します。\n家で弟が待っていますから。", "zh": "我就不去了。\n我弟还在等我回家。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_015_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_015_1031_036kan", "source_sha256": "fc00b0784b1f743b76712212350f2fc50fa0517bedc2004620234056a4266843", "ja": "え～、まだお昼ちょっと過ぎだよ～？\n志保ちゃんも一緒に行こうよ～。友達でしょ？", "zh": "哎～现在才刚过中午而已耶～？\n志保也一起去嘛～我们不是好朋友吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_015_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_015_1032_033sih", "source_sha256": "fe99b3a875408a347980890b50b2ef3ff31500ea5501c2e72605245437703fba", "ja": "と……っ。", "zh": "朋……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_015_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_015_1033_023aka", "source_sha256": "e953adde53f40eae87c0c32c7337bf8e46fadbbbdbe9c1e5de388a0ba8a35eb5", "ja": "そうだよ！　みんなで美味しいプリンを食べるのだ～！\nよっ、{$P$}ちゃんの太っ腹！", "zh": "就是啊！大家一起去吃好吃的布丁啦～！\n呦！小{$P$}真慷慨！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_015_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_015_1034_p", "source_sha256": "f7e2d251d06ea1e82314eba04b75f3e4c7202b56d81121c4477333835ac4ab72", "ja": "（え……っ）", "zh": "（咦……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_015_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_015_1035_033sih", "source_sha256": "bc362432b88eaf501d7a8bfe6eb10d9abfcd116fd12440f5285402f9f010ffcc", "ja": "そんなこと言われても……困ります。", "zh": "就算你们这样讲……也恕难接受邀请。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_015_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_015_1036_023aka", "source_sha256": "e44331a6700cb8ec1942ce47b0bd03ca5db534893a644b04d1f031316433e74d", "ja": "じろじろじー……。", "zh": "我盯我盯我盯盯盯……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_015_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_015_1037_036kan", "source_sha256": "e44331a6700cb8ec1942ce47b0bd03ca5db534893a644b04d1f031316433e74d", "ja": "じろじろじー……。", "zh": "我盯我盯我盯盯盯……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
